QuestGuidance.Register("es",210,{
[6689]="7006EB89\n1\tPut out straw fires (total: 8)\030Tend to wounded Kûr Anzar citizens (total: 6)\030Derrota a los sectarios del que Todo lo Ve (total: 12)\tPut out straw fires and rescue trapped citizens in Kûr Anzar.\n2\tMeet Mizâdi back at the tower of Kûr Anzar\tMeet Mizâdi back at the tower of Kûr Anzar.\n",
[6690]="70059A09\n1\tHabla con Fastrith Halcomida en Zul-mazal\tFastrith has come to Zul-mazal.\n2\tListen to the dwarves discuss the broken mosaic in Zul-mazal\tFastrith and the other dwarves stand in Zul-mazal, discussing the broken mosaic on the wall.\n3\tTalk to Imák in Zul-mazal\tBored by the discussion, Imák has called for you to speak with him. He believes danger is near.\n4\tReturn to Zul-mazal with Imák and ready the defence\tA hobgoblin prey-catcher has found the entrance to Zul-mazal, and before he was slain he alerted his band to your position. You and the dwarves must ready your defence!\n5\tTalk to Bori in Zul-mazal\tBori and the other dwarves prepare to defend Zul-mazal from the hobgoblin hunting-pack. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n6\tRemain alert for any further threats to the dwarves\tYou and the dwarves have defended Zul-mazal from the hobgoblin hunting-party.\n",
[6691]="70000F0C\n1\tHabla con Palma Brownlock\tPalma Rizopardo está esperando para hablar contigo en las colinas fuera de Naerost. De alguna manera, Palma te ha convencido de infiltrarte en las ruinas de Naerost para recuperar la espada Medhrod.\n2\tRecuperar Medhrod\tLa espada Medhrod está en algún lugar dentro de las ruinas de Naerost. Los medio-orcos que la robaron seguramente la tienen bien vigilada dentro de las ruinas.\n3\tHabla con Palma Brownlock\tPalma Rizopardo está en la ladera, fuera de las ruinas de Naerost. Palma espera con entusiasmo tu regreso con Medhrod.\n",
[6692]="70060FB4\n1\tEncuentra el regalo envuelto en el almacén oeste\tDinodas cree que el regalo está guardado en la habitación de atrás, al final de la Sala de Entrada.\n2\t¡Escóndete detrás de la mesa antes de que te vean!\tAlguien se está acercando a tu habitación. ¡Será mejor que te escondas detrás de la mesa!\n3\tUsa liedown\030Usa faint\tAlguien se está acercando a tu habitación. ¡Será mejor que te escondas detrás de la mesa!\n4\tEspera que Prisca vuelva al salón\tDebes esperar hasta que sea seguro moverse sin ser visto.\n5\tEncuentra el regalo envuelto en el almacén oeste\tDinodas cree que el regalo está guardado en la habitación de atrás, al final de la Sala de Entrada.\n6\tEscapa del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel\tCon el regalo seguro en tus manos, debes escapar del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel\n7\tEsconde el regalo en algún sitio... ¡y rápido!\t¡Tienes que esconder el regalo en algún sitio antes de que te encuentren con él!\n8\tEscucha lo que Angélica tiene que decir\tAngélica te está buscando.\n9\tHabla con Angélica Boffin\tAngélica quiere hablar contigo.\n10\tHabla con Prisca Boffin\tPrisca quiere hablar contigo.\n11\tHabla con Angélica Boffin\tAngélica tiene algo más que decirte.\n12\t¡Escucha a Angélica y entretenla para que no os descubra!\tAngélica tiene algo más que decirte.\n13\tAnima para evitar que Angélica encuentre a Dinodas\t¡Rápido! ¡Debes pensar en algo para enmascarar los vítores de Dinodas!\n14\tHabla con Angélica Boffin\t¡Dinodas ha conseguido salir del nº 8 de la calle Aguamiel con el regalo envuelto!\n",
[6693]="70001338\n1\tHabla con Jarl Copperbrace\tJarl Brazodecobre te espera fuera de Ost Galumar. Jarl Brazodecobre desea hablar contigo.\n2\tCuelga los estandartes de los Pueblos Libres en los postes de estandarte (total: 3)\tTres postes de estandarte están colocados en los muros de Ost Galumar. Jarl Brazodecobre te ha pedido izar tres de los estandartes de los Pueblos Libres sobre Ost Galumar.\n3\tHabla con Jarl Copperbrace\tJarl Brazodecobre se encuentra fuera de Ost Galumar. Jarl Brazodecobre espera hablar contigo sobre tu tarea exitosa.\n",
[6694]="7006C74D\n1\tTalk to Girhâzi\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh. You should talk to her.\n2\tEscucha la conversación\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n3\tWave at Khûldim Umûn\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n4\tEscucha la conversación\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n5\tFlex at Khûldim Umûn\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n6\tEscucha la conversación\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n7\tPose for Khûldim Umûn\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n8\tTalk to Girhâzi\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n9\tEscucha la conversación\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n10\tChallenge Khûldim Umûn to trial by combat\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n11\tListen to Khûldim Umûn\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n12\tClap for Khûldim Umûn's decision\tGirhâzi has a plan to get Khûldim Umûn to divulge the location of Dubarâkh, and has asked you to go along with whatever she is saying.\n",
[6695]="70002DDB\n1\tHabla con Slade Ransford\tSlade Ransford está en Ost Cyrn, en las Tierras Solitarias. Slade espera hablar contigo sobre luchar en lo profundo de Ost Cyrn en busca de Mosal-ruk, el vil orco que lidera esta partida de guerra.\n2\tHabla con Slade Ransford\tSlade Ransford está en Ost Cyrn, en las Tierras Solitarias. Slade está descansando rápidamente en lo alto de uno de los edificios en ruinas de Ost Cyrn, y espera hablar contigo sobre avanzar más en las ruinas en busca de Mosal-ruk.\n3\tDesafía a Mosal-ruk\tMosal-ruk se planta desafiante ante ti. Has luchado en lo profundo de Ost Cyrn junto a Slade Ransford, y ha llegado el momento de enfrentar a Mosal-ruk, el líder de la partida de guerra que ocupa las ruinas.\n4\tHabla con Slade Ransford\tSlade Ransford está triunfante en Ost Cyrn. Juntos, tú y Slade recorristeis las ruinas de Ost Cyrn y pusisteis fin a Mosal-ruk y su vil partida de guerra.\n",
[6696]="7006C584\n1\tSpeak with Sigénik\tSigénik awaits you near the gate north of Jirush.\n2\tLook south along the road in the shadow of the gate\tMake your way to the gate and await the arrival of Bosóta Dôlo.\n3\tSpeak with the captain after the battle\tEnter the way-station and defeat Bosóta Dôlo and his escort. Engage them, defeat them, and then confront the captain.\n4\tSpeak with Sigénik north of the gate\tBosóta Dôlo yielded. You should return to Sigénik with the information he provided.\n",
[6697]="70043B45\n1\tHabla con Bingo en el camino\tHas avanzado con Bingo un buen trecho dentro del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío, y un sendero conduce hacia el este en dirección al Bosque de Oro.\n2\tHabla con Bingo en el camino a través del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío\tHas defendido a Bingo de un ataque de un grupo de orcos, y ahora el hobbit está listo para continuar su tranquilo paseo por el Valle del Arroyo Sombrío.\n3\tHabla con Haldir en el camino\tHaldir y varios Elfos han llegado en un momento oportuno, y parece que estaban esperándoos.\n4\tHabla con Bingo en el camino\tHas venido con Bingo a través del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío y te has encontrado con un pequeño grupo de elfos enviados desde Lothlórien para recibiros.\n5\tViaja a Lothlórien con Haldir y Bingo\tHaldir ha pedido que tú y Bingo lo acompañéis a Lothlórien.\n6\tHabla con Bingo dentro de Caras Galadhon\tTú y Bingo habéis sido escoltados hasta Lothlórien, y ahora el hobbit está muy emocionado por aprender todo lo que pueda sobre los Elfos.\n7\tEscucha las palabras de Celeborn y Galadriel\tTú y Bingo os habéis encontrado con Celeborn y Galadriel, y están muy interesados en oír hablar de vuestros viajes.\n8\tHabla con Celeborn\030Habla con Galadriel\tEl Señor y la Dama de Lórien esperan hablar contigo en Caras Galadhon.\n9\tHabla con Bingo en Caras Galadhon\tBingo está dentro de Caras Galadhon, esperando hablar contigo.\n",
[6698]="7005B253\n1\tTalk to Kyrstig\tKyrstig is ready to describe what she saw earlier. You should talk to Kyrstig.\n2\tEscucha la conversación\tKyrstig is describing what she saw transpire between the Angmarim cultist and Loknashra. You should listen to the conversation.\n",
[6699]="700413B9\n1\tSpeak with Borhador\tBorhador heard sounds coming from outside the hall. You should speak with Borhador.\n2\tLeave Borhador and face whatever is pounding upon the walls of the Crossing-hall\tLeave Borhador and face whatever is pounding upon the walls of the Crossing-hall.\n3\tLet the events transpire\tLet the events transpire.\n4\tSpeak with Borhador\tBorhador stands outside the Crossing-hall. You should speak with Borhador.\n",
[6700]="7001B242\n1\tDerrota a los orcos que persiguen a Gollum\tHabla con Miluimil y adéntrate en las cavernas para impedir que los orcos que persiguen a Gollum lo capturen.\n2\tHabla con Miluimil para salir de las oscuras cavernas.\t\n",
[6701]="7002C053\n1\tHabla con Radagast el Pardo\tFrente a ti se sienta Radagast el Pardo, un Mago del orden de Gandalf. Busca tu ayuda en la Guerra del Anillo. Debes hablar con Radagast y ver cómo puedes ayudar. Haz clic derecho en los personajes para interactuar.\n",
[6702]="70058C85\n1\tTalk to Múta\tMúta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. Múta is ready to search for Brathar in Tûr Ágal. You should speak to her when you are prepared.\n2\tFollow Múta and fight your way through Tûr Ágal\tMúta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You should follow Múta into the heights of Tûr Ágal.\n3\tTalk to Múta\tMúta can be found in Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. Múta has paused beside a door in the heights of Tûr Ágal. You should talk to Múta.\n4\tTalk to Múta\tMúta can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You have found Brathar, the Dourhands, and the servants of the Iron Crown gathered in Tûr Ágal. You should talk to Múta.\n5\tObserve the meeting between Brathar and the Iron Crown\tBrathar, the Dourhands, and the servants of the Iron Crown can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You have found Brathar, the Dourhands, and the servants of the Iron Crown gathered in Tûr Ágal. You should observe this meeting and try to remain unseen.\n6\tTalk to Brathar Crack-helm\tBrathar Crack-helm can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You have been discovered by Brathar Crack-helm. You should approach Brathar and talk to him.\n7\tObserve Brathar's departure from Tûr Ágal\tBrathar Crack-helm is departing the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You should remain alert while Brathar and his Dourhands depart.\n8\tTalk to Bandrauth Adder-fang\tBandrauth Adder-fang can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. You have been offered to Bandrauth Adder-fang that he might atone for his failure. You should talk to Bandrauth Adder-fang.\n9\tDefeat Bandrauth Adder-fang\tBandrauth Adder-fang can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. Bandrauth Adder-fang intends to slay you to atone for his failures in Elderslade. You should defend yourself and defeat Bandrauth Adder-fang.\n10\tDefeat Bandrauth Adder-fang and the Dourhands\tBandrauth Adder-fang can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. Sensing that Bandrauth Adder-fang may fail in his task yet again, the Dourhands have entered the fight to ensure that you do not leave Tûr Ágal.\n11\tTalk to Múta\tMúta can be found in the upper chamber of Tûr Ágal, the tower in the centre of Caivád Sâr. With Múta's aid, you have overcome Bandrauth Adder-fang and the Dourhands at Tûr Ágal. You should talk to Múta.\n",
[6703]="7004300B\n1\tHabla con Bingo en la pendiente que conduce a Helegrod\tBingo está en la pendiente nevada que lleva hasta la fortaleza enana de Helegrod.\n2\tHabla con Spalvi en la pendiente por encima de Helegrod\tSpalvi está en la pendiente nevada por encima de Helegrod.\n3\tHabla con Spalvi\tHas derrotado un puñado de nómadas Corcur, pero Spalvi te ha dicho que entre ellos no reconoce a ninguno de los que le emboscaron.\n4\tDirígete a las escaleras que conducen a la puerta de Helegrod\tUn campamento nómada de los Corcur se interpone entre vosotros y las enormes puertas de Helegrod. Spalvi y Bingo se reunirán contigo una vez llegues a la escalera principal.\n5\tSube las escaleras hacia Helegrod con Bingo\tBingo está poco a poco subiendo las escaleras a la puerta de Helegrod, y deberías seguirle.\n6\tHabla con Bingo en lo alto de las escaleras\tBingo espera fuera de la gran puerta de Helegrod, esperando para hablar contigo.\n7\tHabla con Spalvi en lo alto de las escaleras\tSpalvi ha llegado a lo alto de los escalones, frente a la gran puerta de Helegrod.\n8\tHabla con el líder del grupo de los Duramano\tUn grupo de Duramano ha llegado a Helegrod, y su líder desea hablar contigo.\n9\tSobrevive al enfrentamiento con los Duramano\tSpalvi te ha revelado que es un Duramano, y ahora estás en una situación complicada.\n10\tHabla con Bingo\tBingo está siendo retenido por los Duramano a cambio de vuestro buen comportamiento.\n",
[6704]="70030D07\n1\tEscolta el carro por el camino\tRunald y su familia te esperan en la entrada sur de la aldea de Elthengels.\n2\tHabla con Runald\tRunald y su familia han llegado sanos y salvos al puesto comercial junto al camino. Runald desea darte las gracias por ayudarle en su partida.\n",
[6705]="7002CDEB\n1\tLibera a Stanric de sus ataduras.\tStanric está en el calabozo\n2\tHabla con Stanric\tStanric está en la prisión de Stangard.\n3\tAyuda a Stanric a salir de su celda.\tStanric está en la prisión de Stangard.\n4\tEscucha el plan de Stanric\tStanric está en el calabozo de Stangard\n5\tReúne a los hombres en la posada.\tLa taberna de Stangard está llena de Rohirrim sospechosos.\n6\tInforma a Athulf del engaño de Sithric.\tAthulf está en la taberna de Stangard, acompañado por varios hombres igual de sospechosos.\n7\tHabla con Stanric\tStanric se encuentra ahora en el Salón del Hidromiel de Stangard.\n8\tAyuda a Stanric a acabar con Sithric de una vez por todas.\tDefiende a Stanric y derrota a Sithric.\n9\tHabla con Stanric\tStanric está en el Salón del Hidromiel\n",
[6706]="7006EB94\n1\tSpeak with Razâl inside the Angar Aragín\tSpeak with Razâl inside the Angar Aragín.\n2\tGo with Razâl up the tower stairs to find Numûru\030Folllow Razâl and defeat All-seeing cultists (total: 8)\tGo with Razâl up the tower stairs to find Numûru and defeat All-seeing cultists. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n3\tFree Numûru from his bonds\tFree Numûru from his bonds.\n4\tSpeak with Numûru in the Angar Aragín\tSpeak with Numûru in the Angar Aragín.\n5\tSpeak with Razâl\tSpeak with Razâl in the Angar Aragín.\n6\tAscend the stairs and defeat the Barkhûshim (total: 5)\tAscend the stairs and defeat the Barkhûshim guarding the other prisoners.\n7\tFind the other prisoners\tFind the other prisoners.\n8\tFree the first prisoner\030Free the second prisoner\030Free the third prisoner\tFree the prisoners.\n9\tDefeat Karâshna Zíri\tDefeat Karâshna Zíri.\n",
[6707]="70040433\n1\tTalk to Gúrion\tGúrion is standing near the base of the Hill of Erech. You have arrived at the Hill of Erech and should now speak to Gúrion.\n2\tFollow Gúrion up the Hill of Erech\tGúrion is climbing the Hill of Erech. You should follow Gúrion toward the summit of the Hill of Erech.\n3\tFollow Gúrion further up the Hill of Erech\tGúrion is climbing the Hill of Erech. You have defeated the Dead that attacked you, and should continue up the hill.\n4\tFollow Gúrion to the Hill's peak\tGúrion is climbing the Hill of Erech. You have defeated the Dead again, but should now sprint to the Hill's peak in hopes of avoiding continued attacks by the Dead.\n5\tTalk to Gúrion\tGúrion is hiding near the peak of the Hill of Erech. You have reached a point close to the summit, and should now speak to Gúrion.\n6\tTalk to Nerzus\tNerzus is standing at the Stone of Erech. You have followed Gúrion to the Hill's peak, and should now attempt to convince Nerzus and the Ruthless Dead of the invader's deception.\n7\tObserve the meeting of the Dead and Azruthor\tAzruthor and Nerzus are at the Stone of Erech. You should watch the meeting between the invader and the Dead.\n8\tDefeat Nerzus\tNerzus is at the Stone of Erech. You should defeat him before warning the people of Blackroot Vale of Azruthor's summoning of the Dead to Tarlang's Crown.\n9\tTalk to Gúrion\tGúrion is at the peak of the Hill of Erech. You have defeated Nerzus once more, but many of the Dead have rallied to Azruthor's side in Tarlang's Crown.\n",
[6708]="7001792E\n1\tHabla con Andyri\tAndyri está esperando para hablar contigo dentro de las cuevas de los trolls de piedra.\n2\tDefiende a los Elfos hasta que recuperen sus fuerzas\tDebes impedir que los Elfos sean derrotados mientras descansan tras sus batallas.\n3\tHabla con Andyri\tAndyri está en la cueva de los trolls de piedra. Has protegido a los Elfos de Andyri mientras se recuperaban y ahora debes hablar con ella.\n",
[6709]="70035CBD\n1\tHabla con Gárwig\tGárwig está en el Salón del Hidromiel de Forlaw. Deberías hablar con Gárwig.\n2\tSigue a Gárwig y habla con él\tAyuda a Gárwig en Forlaw.\n3\tAyuda a Gárwig en Forlaw\tAyuda a Gárwig en Forlaw.\n4\tAyuda a Gárwig\tHabla con Gárwig en la puerta.\n",
[6710]="7004942D\n1\tAcércate a Galadriel\tDeberías acercarte a Galadriel.\n2\tHabla con Galadriel\tGaladriel se ha acercado a su Espejo y parece lista para mirarlo.\n3\tEscucha lo que muestra el Espejo\tGaladriel está contemplando su Espejo. Párate junto a ella y te contará todo lo que ve.\n4\tHabla con Galadriel\tGaladriel parece haber visto todo lo que podía en el Espejo esta noche y está lista para hablar contigo.\n",
[6711]="700169ED\n1\tAsiste al Concilio final\tAsistir al Concilio final.\n2\tHabla con Glorfindel\tHablar con Glorfindel para volver a Rivendel.\n",
[6712]="7005A7FC\n1\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm. After Azog's defeat and the routing of the Orcs at Azanulbizar, King Thráin has returned to the gates of Khazad-dûm. You should talk to King Thráin.\n2\tFollow King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm.\n3\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm. With the head of Azog prepared, King Thráin intends to send a warning to the Orcs of Moria. You should talk to King Thráin.\n4\tWitness as King Thráin places Azog's head upon a stake at Khazad-dûm\tKing Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm.\n5\tHabla con Nár\tNár can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm. After King Thráin set Azog's head upon a stake, Nár has arrived at the gates of Khazad-dûm. You should talk to Nár.\n6\tWitness as Nár inspects the head of Azog\tNár can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm.\n7\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at the gates of Khazad-dûm. After witnessing Nár return the coin-purse to Azog, King Thráin has beckoned you over. You should talk to King Thráin.\n8\tRest at Durin's Stone\tYou should rest with King Thráin and the surviving Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ at Durin's Stone.\n9\tListen to the council of the Kings of the Seven Houses\030Join the gathering of survivors at Durin's Stone\tSurviving Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ have gathered at Durin's Stone. After a night of fitful rest, you have awoken to find the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ gathered at Durin's Stone. You should join the gathering of survivors there.\n10\tListen to the council of the Kings of the Seven Houses\tThe Kings of the Seven Houses have gathered at Durin's Stone. On the morn after the Battle of Azanulbizar, the Kings of the Seven Houses have again gathered to council. You should listen to the council of the Kings of the Seven Houses.\n11\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found at Durin's Stone. After the other lords and Kings of the Seven Houses have expressed apprehension about continuing the war, King Thráin and the other dwarves have looked to Dáin. You should speak with him now.\n12\tListen to Dáin\tDáin can be found at Durin's Stone. Dáin has been forced to rebuke King Thráin with a tale of the aftermath of Azog's slaying. You should listen to Dáin.\n13\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found in the First Hall of Khazad-dûm. Dáin is recounting his tale of entering the First Hall of Khazad-dûm. You should talk to Dáin.\n14\tListen to Dáin's tale\tDáin is recounting the tale of what he saw in the First Hall of Khazad-dûm.\n15\tUrge the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ to remain calm\tThe Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ can be found at Durin's Stone. After Dáin revealed that he encountered Durin's Bane, the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ have grown uneasy. You should calm them down.\n16\tListen to King Thráin and Thorin\tKing Thráin and Thorin can be found at Durin's Stone. King Thráin has asked Thorin what he believes should be done at Azanulbizar. You should listen to King Thráin and Thorin.\n17\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at Durin's Stone. After Thorin gave his counsel, King Thráin and the other Kings of the Seven Houses have agreed to the war's ending. You should talk to King Thráin.\n18\tAid the Haban'akkâ\tKing Thráin has set the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ on a grim task. You should aid the Haban'akkâ.\n19\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found at Durin's Stone. After the felling of trees and the raising of great pyres at Azanulbizar, the time has come to burn the fallen Kings and their guards at Durin's Stone.\n20\tPay your respects to King Shâlim and the Abnúzhu\030Pay your respects to King Ugún and the Kámbrada\030Pay your respects to King Onúr and the Landorrim\030Pay your respects to King Drógar and the Narfanghoth\030Pay your respects to King Jegín and the Temámir\030Pay your respects to King Vékun and the Zhélruka\tThe Kings of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, Temámir, Kámbrada, Zhélruka, and Abnúzhu can be found at Durin's Stone. Before the final pyres are lit at Durin's Stone, Dáin has suggested that you pay your respects to the Kings of the Seven Houses. Afterward, Dáin has asked you to talk to Thorin.\n21\tTalk to Thorin\tThorin can be found at Durin's Stone. You have paid your respects to the other dwarf-kings. You should talk to Thorin at the central pyre at Durin's Stone.\n22\tFind King Thráin at Kheled-zâram\tKing Thráin might be found by the banks of Kheled-zâram. After preparing the final pyres at Azanulbizar, Thorin has asked you to find King Thráin.\n23\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found by the banks of Kheled-zâram near Durin's Stone. You have found King Thráin at the banks of Kheled-zâram. Speak with him.\n24\tTalk to Thorin\tThorin can be found at Durin's Stone. After finding King Thráin lost in thought beside Kheled-zâram, he told you to return to Thorin and let his son know that he would soon return. You should talk to Thorin.\n25\tWait for King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at Durin's Stone. King Thráin has returned to Durin's Stone. You should wait for King Thráin to give the order to light the final pyres.\n26\tTalk to King Thráin\tKing Thráin can be found at Durin's Stone. You should talk to King Thráin.\n27\tAid King Thráin and light the pyres at Durin's Stone\tThe pyres can be found at Durin's Stone. King Thráin has asked you to join him in lighting the final pyres at Durin's Stone.\n28\tWitness the lighting of the pyres at Durin's Stone\tThe pyres can be found at Durin's Stone.\n29\tTalk to Dáin\tDáin can be found at Durin's Stone. After the lighting of the final pyres, the Sixth War of the Dwarves and Orcs has come to an end. You should talk to Dáin.\n",
[6713]="700451B4\n1\tHabla con Corunir\tYou have come with Corunir to an outpost on the Pelennor where the fighting has been thick.\n2\tFind Golodir\tGolodir has gone ahead. Can you find him before it is too late?\n3\tHabla con Golodir\tGolodir felled the mighty Thrúgrath, but his body is broken and he will not survive.\n4\tHabla con Corunir\tCorunir mourns the loss of his friend on the Pelennor.\n",
[6714]="70015AD5\n1\tDerrota Dragonzuelos alados recién nacidos ([según el diario]/20)\030Derrota Dragonzuelos alados jóvenes ([según el diario]/10)\tCaza a los dragonzuelos más jóvenes evitando a sus hermanos mayores.\n2\tDerrota a Rimlúg la Madre Alada\tLa enfurecida Madre Alada ha descendido al patio en el centro de las ruinas. Enfréntate a ella y derrótala para expulsar a los dragonzuelos de las ruinas para siempre.\n3\tUsa el yunque antiguo\030Recoge Infused Garnet\tUsa la antigua forja para potenciar tu granate imbuido.\n4\tHabla con Perimbant\tHabla con Perimbant para volver a Echad Dúnann.\n",
[6715]="70009EAF\n1\tEntrega la queja formal\tHob Cimacolina te ha pedido que te enfrentes a Will Tuffin, el líder de la gente grande en Dwaling, con su carta.\n",
[6716]="7002EB1A\n1\tConsigue el bate de Heburga\tLos niños de Largafortín están en la granja cerca de la ciudad.\n2\tUsa el bate para golpear a los \"bandidos\" (total: 15)\tUsa el bate para golpear a los \"bandidos\" en la granja.\n3\tHabla con Heburga para ver si concede.\tDebes hablar con Heburga para ver si concede.\n4\tApacigua a los niños dejándoles jugar a los Rohirrim, y deja que te golpeen hasta que te rindas.\tLos niños ahora son los Rohirrim, y tú eres el bandido. Debes dejar que los niños te golpeen.\n5\tHabla con el jinete que te saludó.\tDebes hablar con el jinete que te saludó.\n",
[6717]="70071BCA\n1\tTalk to Gôbezhir\tYou have joined Gôbezhir to present the axe he made to Mêshaget. You should talk to Gôbezhir.\n2\tWatch Gôbezhir present the weapon to Mêshaget\tYou have joined Gôbezhir to present the axe he made to Mêshaget. You watch Gôbezhir give the weapon to its recipient.\n3\tDefeat the roc huntress\tAs you watched Gôbezhir give the weapon to Mêshaget, your company was attacked by a roc huntress. You should defeat the roc attacking you.\n4\tTalk to Mêshaget\tAs you watched Gôbezhir give the weapon to Mêshaget, your company was attacked by a roc huntress. Together, you and Mêshaget defeated the aggressive avian. You should talk to Mêshaget.\n",
[6718]="70000DF5\n1\tHabla con Ulfar\tHabla con Ulfar y luego defiéndelo mientras se adentra más en el campamento de los enanos.\n2\tHabla con Ulfar\tUlfar ha sido herido en la batalla. Habla con él para ver qué quiere que hagas.\n3\tMata al troll de piedra\tUlfar te ha dicho que continúes, más adentro en el campamento de los enanos, sin él, y que mates al troll de piedra si encuentras uno. Ulfar fue herido en la lucha y no pudo seguir contigo. Sin embargo, te dijo que el troll de piedra debe ser eliminado y que estés atento a Olwir, ya que seguramente intentará impedir que mates a la bestia.\n4\tHabla con Ulfar\tCon el troll de piedra y Olwir muertos, regresa con el herido Ulfar y cuéntale lo que ha pasado.\n",
[6719]="7006EEE3\n1\tEnter Amalíbi's encampment near Iridír\tEnter Amalíbi's encampment near Iridír.\n2\tListen to Mizâdi and Amalíbi's conversation\tListen to Mizâdi and Amalíbi's conversation.\n3\tSpeak with Zagêli in Amalíbi's camp\030Speak with Gúrumkir in Amalíbi's camp\030Speak with Jínsa in Amalíbi's camp\tSpeak with several of the wounded soldiers in Amalíbi's camp and ask if they require aid.\n4\tGather fresh bandages for Zagêli\030Find a bottle of Khôrob for Gúrumkir\tHelp Amalíbi's wounded with their various needs.\n5\tGive the fresh bandages to Zagêli\030Give the bottle of Khôrob for Gúrumkir\030Ask to hear Jínsa's story\030Listen to Jínsa's story\tGive the fresh bandages to Zagêli and the Khôrob to Gúrumkir in Amalíbi's camp.\n6\tComfort Jínsa in Amalíbi's encampment\tComfort Jínsa in Amalíbi's encampment.\n7\tLet Mizâdi know you have helped the wounded\tLet Mizâdi know you have helped the wounded.\n8\tListen to Mizâdi and Amalíbi's conversation\tListen to Mizâdi and Amalíbi's conversation.\n9\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Amalíbi's camp\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Amalíbi's camp.\n",
[6720]="7006B70C\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir in front of the waterfall\tMithrandir and your companions prepare to confront the Thardúth.\n2\tConfront Azagath in front of Utug-bûr\tServants of the Thardúth await you at Utug-bûr.\n3\tTalk to Rothog\030Talk to Khôltekh\tAzagath Sea-shadow has suggested that his former allies among the Kindred of the Coins join his new cause.\n4\tRemain on guard during the confrontation with Azagath\tYour companions stand opposed to Azagath Sea-shadow and the Thardúth he now serves.\n5\tRemain on guard during the confrontation with Azagath\tYour companions stand opposed to Azagath Sea-shadow and the Thardúth he now serves.\n",
})
